# Online Food Delivery Customer Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project is an interactive dashboard created to analyze an online food delivery customer dataset.

The dashboard provides a simple visual view of customer demographics, income, age, and ordering behavior.

## Dashboard Features

- Total number of customers
- Average customer age
- Number of customers with positive ordering output
- Monthly income vs ordering behavior
- Customer age distribution
- Occupation-based filtering
- Interactive charts and visualizations

## Dataset

The dataset contains information about online food delivery customers, including:

- Age
- Gender
- Marital Status
- Occupation
- Monthly Income
- Educational Qualifications
- Family Size
- Customer Type
- Location
- Ordering Output
- Feedback

## Tools Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- Plotly
- GitHub

## Project Purpose

The purpose of this dashboard is to turn raw customer data into an interactive and easy-to-understand visual dashboard that can help identify customer patterns and ordering behavior.

